& [PrimitiveRevisionDelta] supersedes the preliminary non-reduction interpretation
  + [revision_uuid] is 107ca165-4cb6-4679-9d8e-ebdc07ee317a
  + [revision_source_snapshot_uuid] is f76493d9-3b6f-49ee-99be-4a414dd0b542
  + [candidate] GroundedIdentityIntegrity is the common faculty-level primitive of Honesty and Security
  + [honesty_grounding] is correspondence, evidence, attribution, status, context, and semantic continuity
  + [security_grounding] is authority, admissibility, protected identity, constraint, stability, and effect continuity
  + [detectability] no detectable material delta within declared scope is distinct from proof that no falsehood, harm, or violation exists
  + [materiality] causal change to the semantic or operational landscape under declared purpose, scope, resolution, and horizon
  + [accumulation] sub-threshold deltas require trajectory accounting because combined change may become material
  + [candidate_feature_set] is now HSIBI-001 through HSIBI-023 with HSIBI-007 and HSIBI-008 requiring revised wording
  + [readiness] remains source_preserved_assessed_not_implementation_ready
  + [next_slice] remains HSIBI-SJS-01 but must be conflict-aware across both preserved sources and assessments
  - never: interpret an unavailable causal trace as proof of innocence, harmlessness, or honest intent

& [IdentityRecognitionDAGDelta] defines the proposed common enforcement substrate
  + [revision_uuid] is fbb2560a-ded9-469f-8b18-7ae492bff9f8
  + [source_snapshot_uuid] is 005e2e1f-a5ee-4843-99c7-09642997a4cf
  + [graph_model] is one typed graph fabric with acyclic derivation, revision, admission, and bounded execution projections rather than one universal DAG
  + [identity_basin] is stable key, immutable revision, grounds, invariants, typed edges, proof, and uncertainty
  + [recognition_limit] signature and digest prove artifact identity and admitted lineage but not truth, correct referent binding, safety, or harmlessness
  + [candidate_boundary] unstable proposals remain content-addressed, non-authoritative, effectless, bounded, and excluded from admitted traversal
  + [promotion] separate Honesty and Security returns plus Observer disposition produce a new immutable admitted revision and proof
  + [candidate_feature_set] adds IRDG-001 through IRDG-012 to HSIBI preparation
  + [readiness] remains source_preserved_assessed_not_implementation_ready
  - never: call graph-level quarantine a physical sandbox without a separately proved isolation mechanism

& [BoundaryOperatingAccommodationDelta] defines controlled breach and recovery behavior
  + [revision_uuid] is 5697b4f6-6d3b-4e24-9896-c63e9320cb09
  + [source_snapshot_uuid] is 301d779b-e108-401f-8cb2-346677f72b29
  + [signal] a proof-carrying BoundaryIntegritySignal holds affected authority and effects while loading pertinent contracts and faculties
  + [operating_contract] facts, assumptions, purpose, boundaries, authority, protected identities, effects, materiality, and closure become explicit
  + [accommodation] known broken state may operate only through exact allowlists, limits, controls, monitoring, stop conditions, and recovery
  + [reconstitution] a new identity boundary encloses the affected region without erasing the predecessor boundary or breach
  + [trust] the contract defines acceptance conditions while passing those conditions reestablishes qualified trust
  + [stability_ratchet] breach-derived violation predicates, tests, monitoring, responses, and non-regression form the new standard
  + [candidate_feature_set] adds BOAC-001 through BOAC-019 to HSIBI preparation
  + [readiness] remains source_preserved_assessed_not_implementation_ready
  - never: represent an accommodated breach as intact or let intended purpose self-authorize an exception
